&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The City of Richland appreciates the public&rsquo;s patience as crews complete these final improvements. Motorists are encouraged to use caution, obey posted signage, and allow extra travel time when moving through the area.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For project updates and additional information, visit &lt;strong&gt;richlandwa.gov/SouthGWay&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

