&lt;p dir="ltr" style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Harefest LLC Announces &ldquo;Legends Reloaded&rdquo;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p dir="ltr" style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;A High Desert Rock &rsquo;n&rsquo; Roll Fantasy Comes to Madras, Oregon, June 19&ndash;20, 2026&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p dir="ltr" style="text-align:center"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;Madras, OR &mdash; January 26, 2026 &mdash; Harefest LLC, the Pacific Northwest festival producer behind Harefest, Capital City Retro Fest, 90&rsquo;s Flannel Fest, and Seattle Retro Fest, is proud to announce &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Legends Reloaded&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;, a two-day classic rock tribute festival taking place June 19&ndash;20, 2026 at the Jefferson County Event Complex in Madras, Oregon.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;Set against the dramatic high desert landscape of Central Oregon, Legends Reloaded celebrates the music of rock&rsquo;s most iconic artists, performed by top-tier bands from across the region. The inaugural lineup features faithful, high-energy tributes to legendary acts: Fleetwood Mac, Eagles, Tom Petty, Heart, Lynyrd Skynyrd, Creedence Clearwater Revival, ZZ Top, Bad Company, Hall &amp;amp; Oates, the Doobie Brothers, and The Allman Brothers Band.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p dir="ltr"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;Confirmed performers:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p dir="ltr"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;Taken by the Sky &ndash; Fleetwood Mac&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;Eagle Eyes &ndash; Eagles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;Petty Fever &ndash; Tom Petty&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;Barracuda &ndash; Heart&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;Whiskey River &ndash; Lynyrd Skynyrd&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;Bad Moon Riders &ndash; Creedence Clearwater Revival&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;El Loco &ndash; ZZ Top&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;Rock Steady &ndash; Bad Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;Hall and Bros &ndash; Hall &amp;amp; Oates + Doobie Brothers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;Revival Brothers &ndash; Allman Brothers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;Legends Reloaded is an &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;all-ages music event&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt; with optional overnight RV/Tent camping available for ages 21 &amp;amp; over. Overnight access is strictly limited to guests 21+.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;&ldquo;We are excited to bring this multi-day festival to Central Oregon,&rdquo; said Bart Platt, Event Complex Manager. &ldquo;This family-friendly festival is exactly the kind of entertainment we strive to deliver to Jefferson County. Music can bring people together like no other form of entertainment&mdash;it proves we are more similar than we are different. We invite everyone to come celebrate our similarities June 19&ndash;20 at the first-ever Legends Reloaded Music Festival.&rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

